WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.600
Now, everyone.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.650
The consecutive fights between
Domon and the Shuffle Alliance...

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.110
...arranged by Neo Hong Kong's
Prime Minister Wong Yunfat...

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:35.900
...is finally coming to an end
with Argo Gulskii of Neo Russia.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.110
However...

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:42.370
...another mysterious shadow
appears to be cast over this fight.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.910
Domon and Allenby
will make up a tag team...

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.870
...for the second time.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:51.290
But the problem is that Argo's
tag team partner is...

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.060
...the one who got this far
only to try to kill Argo.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.840
It was Graham of the
Lumber Gundam.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.880
Neo Canada Lumber Gundam


00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.630
And now!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:03.600
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.850
Domon vs. Argo!
Charging Bolt Gundam

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.650
Argo!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.080
I'm not done yet!

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.920
Wow.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.710
So, that's Graham of Neo Canada.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.840
Came all the way here
just to fight Argo.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.970
No.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.550
This is no fight.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.720
To Graham,
this is about revenge.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.680
Revenge?

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.600
Yeah.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.980
Back when Argo was
a space pirate...

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.980
...his ship caused an accident
during an escape.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.940
As a result...

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.650
Graham's wife lost her life.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:03.200
Graham blamed Argo for that...

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.780
...and became a Gundam Fighter
just for this.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.490
And he made it all the way
to the Finals?

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:11.830
Argo.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:14.830
Today's the day
I'm going to settle this.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.210
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.670
<i>You'll never save your friends</i>
<i>if you don't do better!</i>

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.220
She's right.
I will not lose the match...

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.430
...if I'm gonna save my friends!

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:30.930
What's going on?!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.700
Bolt Gundam's...!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.200
Don't tell me he's going into
Hyper Mode!

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.220
A-amazing!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.770
What a technique!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.400
You've finally mastered it.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.310
By destroying the land structure...

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.860
...the Gaia Crusher turns it
into a weapon.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.210
This is now settled, Graham.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.080
I trust you're now satisfied.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.130
N-not yet!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.920
I still cannot forgive you
for what you did!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.680
And checkmate.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:47.430
Yes.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:48.930
Domon.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.100
It'll be your turn next.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.180
Yeah, I know.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.640
Yes.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.400
The time's finally come
for our decisive battle.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.690
That's right.
I'll stake my crest on it.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.360
Domon's no longer needed?!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.650
That's right.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.820
The ultimate Fighter
we're looking for...

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.780
...to assist in the Devil Gundam's
resurrection...

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.330
...is clearly not Domon.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.080
Then, who do you have in mind?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.460
Underneath your hand, Master.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.290
What?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.550
But this is...

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.880
What do you think, Master East?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.930
But this Fighter
is still inexperienced.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.260
Nonsense.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.810
Her true abilities will
become clear in the next match.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.680
<i>Prime Minister Wong</i>...

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.350
...<i>I've brought you the</i>
<i>man you asked to see</i>.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.310
Very well.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.650
You know which room
to escort our guest to.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.360
Treat him with courtesy.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.610
Well, then...

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.030
...shall we begin our preparations?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.570
So, once and for all I can
prove to you that I am right.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.290
Think it'll be easy?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.560
All right.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.350
I mastered this new technique,
the Gaia Crusher...

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.260
...while in the Guyana Highlands.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.400
I'll use this to win the championship...

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.280
...and free my comrades.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.450
What's this?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.360
What's going on?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.620
Neo Russia's spaceship?!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.250
I'm inside the ship.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.170
That's...

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.130
Mikhail! Rimskii!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.130
Bering! Sergei!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.340
What're you doing here?!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.350
They're just holograms...

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.600
Cut out these cheap tricks!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.570
What's this about?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.950
Silence!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.740
These are orders
from headquarters.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.540
Presumably to stir up
your will to fight.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.450
Why do it now?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.870
It has to do with your next match.

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:22.870
What?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.750
No way!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.920
Argo and Graham team up...

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.720
...to fight against Domon
and Allenby?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.680
Argo's teamed up with
a man who's after his life?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:36.890
Where's Domon?

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.560
Weird thing is...

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:42.600
...when he saw this matchup, he
took off to the Neo Canada lodge.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.150
Take a hike!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.740
Nothing can change my mind!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.740
I won't let this chance pass me by.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:53.990
So...

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.780
...you still blame Argo.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.580
But that was an accident, right?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.830
The report was from Neo Russia.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.920
No one knows what the truth is.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.830
That's right.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.550
I'll decide with my own hands
if that man's innocent or not.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.880
But you already lost to him!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.010
So, why...?!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.720
You think I can just
team up with him?!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.640
And act like we're buddies?!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.980
All I'm asking...

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.900
...is that you don't ruin
a match against Argo.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.860
If you're a true Gundam Fighter...

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.110
...try communicating
with your fists.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.360
I'm sure you'll see the truth.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.860
With my fists...

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.750
He sure is persistent.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.580
But don't you worry.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:47.830
I'll keep Graham off your back.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.920
Allenby...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.210
Be extra careful.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.300
It's a tag team match
arranged by Wong.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.130
It won't end without incident.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.590
Well, so be it!

00:08:56.590 --> 00:09:00.220
We'll join forces and
do the best we can.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.430
Right!

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.020
Bye, Domon.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.730
Dr. Belliman's on my case
about always coming home late.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:12.730
See ya!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:13.990
Allenby...

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:15.990
Uh, well...

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.360
Just be careful.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.530
Thanks!

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.590
H-hey, this is...

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.800
...the Berserker System.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:39.180
Welcome, Dr. Belliman.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:42.640
You're right.
It's the Berserker System.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.390
Prime Minister Wong!

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.350
What's going on here?!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.770
You didn't steal this machine
from Neo Sweden, did you?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.440
Don't insult us like that.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:55.820
Neo Hong Kong has
developed its own machine.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.030
And today, I wanted you...

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.070
...the inventor of this machine...

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.830
...to be present as we
celebrate our success.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.290
Wh-what?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.330
Before that...

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.750
...tell me something.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:08.580
Yes.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.080
Allenby Beardsley's...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.840
The frequency of the brain waves
that control her.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.090
N-no way!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.710
I'll never tell!

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.470
Sure about that?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.900
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.790
Who called me out here?

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.590
I did, Argo.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:02.260
Nastasha?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.600
What's wrong?

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:13.860
Aren't you hungry?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.310
Can't use chopsticks?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.070
Or maybe...

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.570
...it's this teaming up with Graham?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.780
Consider this my apology to you.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.120
Look over at that ship.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.290
That's...!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.170
They have gone too far.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:37.630
The authorities even brought
your friends out here.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.210
Frankly, it makes me angry, too.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.340
Over the past year we've
fought hard to get this far...

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.350
...and yet this is the extent
of their trust in us.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.180
Argo...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.980
When you fight Domon tomorrow,
win your match.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.770
And destroy Graham if you must.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.610
It's one win, but it's ours both!

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.410
A shooting star...

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.290
In the Colony, it means bad luck.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.140
However...

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:31.600
...can one give up
revenge so easily?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.310
What're you saying?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:37.690
You think he'll try something
against Argo during the Fight?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.440
I do not know for certain.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.230
However...

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.190
You're right...

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.070
In today's Fight...

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:46.160
...there's no doubt Graham's
actions hold the key!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.280
Schwarz Bruder.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.740
You know what action
Graham will take?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.080
No.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:55.250
Only Graham himself
has the answer to that.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.510
If you're a true Gundam Fighter...

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.800
...try communicating with your fists.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.930
I'm sure you'll see the truth.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.350
Graham...

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.100
...no matter how vengeful
you may be...

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.230
...the only enemy I see before me
is Domon Kasshu!

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:21.190
Allenby...

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.780
I'm leaving Graham to you.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.450
Let me fight one-on-one with Argo.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.490
Yup! Leave it to me!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.530
Allenby...

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.120
Dr. Belliman's not back yet...

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.540
...so we won't be able to
use our Berserker System.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.660
That suits me fine!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.370
But where did Dr. Belliman go?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.130
That Wong.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.090
He tells me to watch
the match without him.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:51.260
What's he up to?

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.690
It appears that the cast
is now in place.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.360
Dr. Belliman...

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.650
Why don't you sit back
and observe?

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:06.610
I'm about to show you the proper
way to use the Berserker System.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.080
Here we go! Gundam Fight!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.040
Ready!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.750
Go!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.290
Come, Domon Kasshu!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:18.790
Good, Argo!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.630
Just forget about Graham!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.000
Right.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.710
I'm not letting anyone
interfere with this match!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.010
This is...!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.980
His technique created a ring
just for the two of them.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.480
I like it.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.730
Now we can focus on each other!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.110
Yes, Domon!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.150
Here I go!

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:55.030
I must defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.580
And save my dad!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.160
I must set free my comrades!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.540
I can't afford to lose!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.550
Yes, Argo! That's superb!

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.710
Now, settle this battle!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.180
Yet, I'm still concerned.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.430
What will that man do?

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.220
That Andrew Graham...

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.350
Now!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.480
I won't let you interfere
with Domon's fight!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.610
This is great.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.030
I couldn't have asked for
a better scenario.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.950
Now!
Prepare the Berserker System!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.620
Fire!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.920
Allenby?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.470
Could it be the Berserker System?!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.630
That's impossible!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.390
We haven't activated the System!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:57.600
Could it be...?!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.890
That Wong!

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.100
Who'd expect he'd stoop so low?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.060
Let's go! Fuun Saiki!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.780
Stop it!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.610
Turn off the system, please!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:13.780
Okay.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.570
I'm increasing the power!

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:16.450
Wong!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.900
This is truly beneath you!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:20.660
Master East!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.830
Stop it now!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.580
You think any good can
come of this?!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.130
Master East...

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.210
Spare me your lectures.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.710
Allenby, in her berserker state...

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.720
...is clearly the ultimate Fighter!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.760
Silence!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.970
I will stop you by force!

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.430
So!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.640
What now, Wong?!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.030
Undefeated of the East...

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.260
...you're growing old.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.490
Domon!
Please help me!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.210
That's...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.170
No.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.460
There's still something
I need to find out for myself.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.210
Yes.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.090
The true identity of that man,
Argo.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.310
Why, Argo?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.520
Why do you fight
as hard as you do?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.070
Why is it?

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:41.910
Why, Argo?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.870
Argo Gulskii!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:49.790
Pretty good, Argo!

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:53.050
That's why we need you
in the Shuffle Alliance!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.300
Yeah!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:57.300
I haven't forgotten my role
as the Black Joker!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:01.370
But right now we must
finish our battle!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:03.180
Then I'll end it right now!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.810
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.650
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.280
Erupting...

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:22.260
...God Finger!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.700
Bursting...

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:28.160
...Gaia Crusher!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.710
Gotcha!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.050
Argo!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.750
I have won!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:44.310
No!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.520
You haven't seen...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.850
...the true power of the
Gaia Crusher!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.400
Wh-what's this...?!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.280
Cracks in the God Finger?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.240
Argo, are you trying to...?!

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:02.740
That's right.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.790
It's the only way I can beat you!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.910
Even if we defeat each other!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.080
Stop it, Argo!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.120
If your head's damaged...

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.790
...you could be hurt badly!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:13.790
Nastasha!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.260
If anything should happen to me,
look after my friends.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.220
You would give your life?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:28.350
Are the lives of your friends
that important to you?

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.060
More than your own life?

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.440
Yes, I remember.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.850
You tried to save my wife!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.240
And now...

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.080
And now I can finally
believe you...

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.080
Argo Gulskii!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.040
Argo!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.630
You're awesome!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.880
But I can't...

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:58.380
...I can't afford to lose as well!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.300
I see...

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.630
Here I go!

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:06.000
God Field!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.850
Dash!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.310
Argo!

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:16.730
What?

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:17.940
Oh, no!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:22.780
Am I going to lose?

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:25.450
Argo!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.370
I never thought...

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:34.000
...the Gaia Crusher was causing
such stress on Bolt Gundam's legs.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.000
I'm sorry.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.430
That there's a flaw in the machinery
at such a crucial moment.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.550
The defeat is mine.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.090
Nonsense.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.680
It's just one loss, but it...

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.970
...belongs to the two of us, right?

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.680
Argo...

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.160
And Domon Kasshu...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.900
...I promise to join in your battle.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.190
Good.

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.900
Now we're all together.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.610
The other Shuffle Alliance
members are waiting.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:08.990
Allenby!

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.490
Where is he?!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.460
Where is Domon's enemy?!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.920
Bolt Gundam!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.130
Is it you?!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.590
Damn.
Argo's in no shape to fight.

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:23.720
I'll defeat my enemy!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.130
Stop!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:33.430
Graham!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.440
Why'd you do that, Graham?!

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:43.440
Your own two fists have
shown me the light to my soul.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:44.940
I'm sorry.

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.410
This is about the only thing
I can do for you.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:51.990
Graham!

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.950
Allenby!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.170
Domon!

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:00.960
Argo!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.210
For God's sake!

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:06.550
That's beautiful...

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:09.340
That's beautiful, Allenby!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.600
Allenby!

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:27.860
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:35.660
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:38.210
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:47.010
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.970 --> 00:23:01.270
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:05.820
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.720
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:35.260
While Domon searches
for Allenby...

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.890
...Master Asia challenges him
to a fight.

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.310
But a Gundam Head appears
and attacks them both!

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:44.310
The former teacher and pupil
join forces and...

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.440
...fight with the secret
techniques of the...

00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:48.650
...School of the Undefeated
of the East!

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.950
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:56.120
The Ultimate Attack!
Duel With Master Asia

00:23:53.910 --> 00:24:00.210
The Ultimate Attack!
Duel With Master Asia

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.290
Ready! Go!
